From d6e4f03bb198df9be3dba81506c39632b261a409 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dmitry Mostovoy <stavultras@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 17:18:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 27/27] hw/arm/filogic: 74HC595 LEDs, SPI-NOR + SPI-NAND
 boards, Airoha EN8811H

- hc595.c: 74HC595 shift register chain on a SPI bus (Linux
  gpio-74x164): one byte per register per message, latched on CS
  deassert.  LED panel source hc595:BUS:N (output N), e.g. the
  Teltonika RUTC50 mobile / SIM / signal LEDs on SPI1.
- nor-nand=on: a board with a SPI-NOR and a SPI-NAND (Teltonika RUTC50:
  NOR boot, system in UBI on the NAND; OpenWrt One: NAND boot, recovery
  in the NOR).  nand-dir holds the NOR partition files, its folder
  "nand" the NAND ones; flash=nor or nand selects the boot flash.
- mtk-eth: Airoha EN8811H 2.5G PHY (gmac0/gmac1=en8811h): the c22
  page 4 buckpbus window, MCU ready after the firmware download, link
  partner 2.5G, the speed register and its three LEDs.

Signed-off-by: Dmitry Mostovoy <stavultras@gmail.com>
